## Our story

Eagle Span Corporation was founded by Marion Buchanan, for the same reason many
of our customers chose their own career paths. He wanted to do more than work a
job under someone else’s direction.

Self-determination — working out our own vision, on our own terms — matters
here. We encourage our people to think for themselves and to say when a process
or the shop around it could be better. That is not a slogan; it is how the work
actually gets improved.

We have served the Greater Charlotte area since 1998, and some genuinely
interesting people have crossed paths with us in that time. We are looking
forward to meeting the rest of you.

